# CAT-10: a whole format word after the number in such a tag, searched without it ("61422-3116-1
# LP", "TOOL 8391 (2LP)", "XYZ 123 CD"): LP, 2LP / 2xLP, CD, MC, EP, Vinyl - never a digit of the
